{"id":"c961cdc706a4cc08","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-comb5-tree-level.md","title":"ZFC Comb5 Tree Level","display":"df-zfc-comb5-tree-level — ZFC Comb5 Tree Level","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-comb5-tree-level","aliases":["58-df-zfc-comb5-tree-level"],"display":"df-zfc-comb5-tree-level — ZFC Comb5 Tree Level","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-tree]]","[[58-df-ordinal]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-comb5-tree-level"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-comb5-tree-level</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-comb5-tree-level — ZFC Comb5 Tree Level"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f06e57c5c0b1354d\" href=\"?note=f06e57c5c0b1354d\" title=\"58-df-tree\">58-df-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (tree)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> (tree order)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> (level ordinal)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> (candidate <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-level of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tree}\">\\(\\mathrm{Tree}\\)</span> (tree predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f06e57c5c0b1354d\" href=\"?note=f06e57c5c0b1354d\" title=\"58-df-tree\">58-df-tree</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> (ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate used for the order isomorphism, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcComb5TreeLevel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcComb5TreeLevel}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb5\\text{-}tree\\text{-}level} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb5TreeLevel}_S(T,R,\\alpha,L)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Tree}(T,R)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land L=\\left\\{t\\in T:\\exists f\\in V\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(f,\\{s\\in T:\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in R\\land s\\neq t\\},\\alpha\\right)\\land\\operatorname{ran}(f)=\\alpha\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall s,u\\in\\{v\\in T:\\langle v,t\\rangle\\in R\\land v\\neq t\\}\\;\\bigl((\\langle s,u\\rangle\\in R\\land s\\neq u)\\leftrightarrow f(s)\\in f(u)\\bigr)\\end{aligned}\\right]\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb5\\text{-}tree\\text{-}level} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb5TreeLevel}_S(T,R,\\alpha,L)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Tree}(T,R)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land L=\\left\\{t\\in T:\\exists f\\in V\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(f,\\{s\\in T:\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in R\\land s\\neq t\\},\\alpha\\right)\\land\\operatorname{ran}(f)=\\alpha\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall s,u\\in\\{v\\in T:\\langle v,t\\rangle\\in R\\land v\\neq t\\}\\;\\bigl((\\langle s,u\\rangle\\in R\\land s\\neq u)\\leftrightarrow f(s)\\in f(u)\\bigr)\\end{aligned}\\right]\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The level is defined by an explicit order isomorphism from the strict predecessor set to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>, instead of an untyped order-type operator call.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-tree","status":"resolved","id":"f06e57c5c0b1354d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-tree","status":"resolved","id":"f06e57c5c0b1354d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Tree}$ (tree predicate, see [[58-df-tree]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}$ (ordinal predicate, see [[58-df-ordinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (function predicate used for the order isomorphism, see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Tree}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcComb5TreeLevel}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb5\\text{-}tree\\text{-}level} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb5TreeLevel}_S(T,R,\\alpha,L)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Tree}(T,R)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land L=\\left\\{t\\in T:\\exists f\\in V\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}&\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(f,\\{s\\in T:\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in R\\land s\\neq t\\},\\alpha\\right)\\land\\operatorname{ran}(f)=\\alpha\\\\&\\land\\forall s,u\\in\\{v\\in T:\\langle v,t\\rangle\\in R\\land v\\neq t\\}\\;\\bigl((\\langle s,u\\rangle\\in R\\land s\\neq u)\\leftrightarrow f(s)\\in f(u)\\bigr)\\end{aligned}\\right]\\right\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false}],"bytes":1453,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1663","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-comb5-tree-level.md|58-df-zfc-comb5-tree-level]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","f06e57c5c0b1354d","5582a281f15a33c2","36d7463d215be751"]}